### login
POST http://127.0.0.1:9090/authentication/login
Content-Type:  application/json

{
    "email": "admin@gmail.com",
    "password": "Abdul@123"
}

### signup with Google
POST http://127.0.0.1:9090/authentication/google-signUp
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "idToken": "paste-a-google-id-token-here"
}

